rmal`. Returns its index in that shape's pool.\n165\t- `count(shape?: DecalShape): number`: Marks alive (per shape or all).\n166\t- `update(dt: number): void`: Per frame: age the marks; old ones dither away over a second.\n167\t- `clear(): void`: Remove every mark (the meshes stay for reuse).\n168\t- `dispose(): void`\n169\t\n170\t### type DecalShape\n171\t\n172\t```ts\n173\ttype DecalShape = (typeof DECAL_SHAPES)[number]\n174\t```\n175\t\n176\t### decodeState()\n177\t\n178\t```ts\n179\tfunction decodeState(v: unknown): unknown\n180\t```\n181\t=== class VerletBody (line 2057)\n182\t### class VerletBody\n183\t\n184\t- `new VerletBody(count: number, o: VerletOptions = {})`\n185\t- `readonly count: number`\n186\t- `readonly pos: Float32Array`: Positions, xyz per particle.\n187\t- `readonly prev: Float32Array`: Last step's positions (velocity = pos − prev).\n188\t- `readonly invMass: Float32Array`: 0 for pinned particles.\n189\t- `readonly pinAt: Float32Array`: Where pinned particles are held (move them to drag a cloth by its corner).\n190\t- `ea: Uint32Array<ArrayBuffer>`: Distance constraints: particle pairs, rest lengths and stiffness 0..1.\n191\t- `eb: Uint32Array<ArrayBuffer>`\n192\t- `rest: Float32Array<ArrayBuffer>`\n193\t- `stiff: Float32Array<ArrayBuffer>`\n194\t- `tris: Uint32Array<ArrayBuffer>`: Triangles (cloth and blobs): wind drag, volume and drawing.\n195\t- `gravity: [number, number, number]`\n196\t- `wind: [number, number, number]`: Wind velocity (m/s): drags triangles (by their facing) or particles (ropes).\n197\t- `gust: number`: How much the wind varies in time and space (0..1).\n198\t- `drag: number`: How hard the wind pushes. Cloth: acceleration per (m/s)² of wind hitting it squarely (light cloth: high; canvas: low). Ropes: per m/s of speed relative to the wind.\n199\t- `skin: number`: Cloth: drag along its surface, as a share of `drag` (it streams a flag out).\n200\t- `iterations: number`\n201\t- `damping: number`\n202\t- `floor: number | null`: A