{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Jjkrp7peoUWhf6JXXhyi1t","type":"tool_result","content":"pixel_heroes:{scene:[],actors:kJ(AJ()),environment:kJ(jJ)},pixel_world:{scene:[],actors:kJ(jJ),environment:kJ(AJ())},chunky_world:{scene:[],actors:kJ(AJ()),environment:kJ({...fJ.blocky})}\n      1 DEFAULT_PIXEL\n      1 {size:1,outline:.45,crease:.08}\n      1 {size:1,outline:.85,crease:.2}\n      1 {size:1,outline:0,crease:0}\n### DEFAULT_PIXEL\n\n```ts\nconst DEFAULT_PIXEL: Readonly<PixelLook>\n```\n\n### defaultLook()\n\n### interface LayerLook\n\nA layer's own look: its source (pixel art or clean) and its filters.\n\n- `pixel: PixelLook | null`: Pixel-art settings, or null for clean full-resolution rendering.\n- `filters: LookFilter[]`\n\n### interface Look\n\n- `scene: LookFilter[]`: Filters on the composed frame (both layers).\n- `actors: LayerLook`\n- `environment: LayerLook`\n\n### PIXEL_PARAMS\n\n```ts\nconst PIXEL_PARAMS: readonly FilterParam[]\n```\n\n### PIXEL_PRESETS\n\n```ts\nconst PIXEL_PRESETS: Readonly<Record<string, Readonly<PixelLook>>>\n```\n\n### interface PixelLook\n\nPixel-art rendering of a layer: the scene at the art resolution with outlines.\n\n- `size: number`: Art pixels per rendered pixel: 1 = the native art resolution, 2+ = chunkier.\n- `outline: number`: Silhouette (depth) outline darkening, 0..1.\n- `crease: number`: Internal crease highlight (normal edges), 0..1. Keep it weak.\n\n1255384\nGUIDE.md:432:ctx.hud.text(6, 6, `SCORE ${score}`, { color: 'sand' });            // 5×7 font, UPPERCASE\nGUIDE.md:1014:| HUD text shows gaps | characters the 5×7 font doesn't have | uppercase letters, digits, common punctuation |\nAPI.md:2782:- `text(x: number, y: number, text: string, options: HudOptions = {}): void`: Text in the 5×7 bitmap font (uppercase; digits and common punctuation).\nAPI.md:2808:- `scale?: number`: Integer art-pixel scale (2 = double-size glyphs). Default 1.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8b716b92-81c2-4c62-8381-9131b2f861f1","uuid":"82901073-4074-4d67-85a5-6c6b5f1aa23d","timestamp":"2026-11-05T04:41:18.784Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"pixel_heroes:{scene:[],actors:kJ(AJ()),environment:kJ(jJ)},pixel_world:{scene:[],actors:kJ(jJ),environment:kJ(AJ())},chunky_world:{scene:[],actors:kJ(AJ()),environment:kJ({...fJ.blocky})}\n      1 DEFAULT_PIXEL\n      1 {size:1,outline:.45,crease:.08}\n      1 {size:1,outline:.85,crease:.2}\n      1 {size:1,outline:0,crease:0}\n### DEFAULT_PIXEL\n\n```ts\nconst DEFAULT_PIXEL: Readonly<PixelLook>\n```\n\n### defaultLook()\n\n### interface LayerLook\n\nA layer's own look: its source (pixel art or clean) and its filters.\n\n- `pixel: PixelLook | null`: Pixel-art settings, or null for clean full-resolution rendering.\n- `filters: LookFilter[]`\n\n### interface Look\n\n- `scene: LookFilter[]`: Filters on the composed frame (both layers).\n- `actors: LayerLook`\n- `environment: LayerLook`\n\n### PIXEL_PARAMS\n\n```ts\nconst PIXEL_PARAMS: readonly FilterParam[]\n```\n\n### PIXEL_PRESETS\n\n```ts\nconst PIXEL_PRESETS: Readonly<Record<string, Readonly<PixelLook>>>\n```\n\n### interface PixelLook\n\nPixel-art rendering of a layer: the scene at the art resolution with outlines.\n\n- `size: number`: Art pixels per rendered pixel: 1 = the native art resolution, 2+ = chunkier.\n- `outline: number`: Silhouette (depth) outline darkening, 0..1.\n- `crease: number`: Internal crease highlight (normal edges), 0..1. Keep it weak.\n\n1255384\nGUIDE.md:432:ctx.hud.text(6, 6, `SCORE ${score}`, { color: 'sand' });            // 5×7 font, UPPERCASE\nGUIDE.md:1014:| HUD text shows gaps | characters the 5×7 font doesn't have | uppercase letters, digits, common punctuation |\nAPI.md:2782:- `text(x: number, y: number, text: string, options: HudOptions = {}): void`: Text in the 5×7 bitmap font (uppercase; digits and common punctuation).\nAPI.md:2808:- `scale?: number`: Integer art-pixel scale (2 = double-size glyphs). Default 1.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Jjkrp7peoUWhf6JXXhyi1t","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
