*   [Recent changes](/wiki/Special:RecentChanges \"A list of recent changes to Wikipedia [r]\")\n*   [Upload file](/wiki/Wikipedia:File_upload_wizard \"Add images or other media for use on Wikipedia\")\n*   [Special pages](/wiki/Special:SpecialPages \"A list of all special pages [q]\")\n\n  [![](/static/images/icons/enwiki-25.svg) ![Wikipedia](/static/images/mobile/copyright/wikipedia-wordmark-en-25.svg) ![The Free Encyclopedia](/static/images/mobile/copyright/wikipedia-tagline-en-25.svg)](/wiki/Main_Page)\n\n[Search](/wiki/Special:Search \"Search Wikipedia [f]\")\n\nSearch\n\n Appearance\n\n*   [Donate](https://donate.wikimedia.org/?wmf_source=donate&wmf_medium=sidebar&wmf_campaign=en.wikipedia.org&uselang=en)\n*   [Create account](/w/index.php?title=Special:CreateAccount&returnto=Trauma+Center \"You are encouraged to create an account and log in; however, it is not mandatory\")\n*   [Log in](/w/index.php?title=Special:UserLogin&returnto=Trauma+Center \"You're encouraged to log in; however, it's not mandatory. [o]\")\n\n Personal tools\n\n*   [Donate](https://donate.wikimedia.org/?wmf_source=donate&wmf_medium=sidebar&wmf_campaign=en.wikipedia.org&uselang=en)\n*   [Create account](/w/index.php?title=Special:CreateAccount&returnto=Trauma+Center \"You are encouraged to create an account and log in; however, it is not mandatory\")\n*   [Log in](/w/index.php?title=Special:UserLogin&returnto=Trauma+Center \"You're encouraged to log in; however, it's not mandatory. [o]\")\n\nContents\n--------\n\nmove to sidebar hide\n\n*   [\n    \n    (Top)\n    \n    ](#)\n*   [\n    \n    1 See also\n    \n    ](#See_also)\n    \n\n Toggle the table of contents\n\nTrauma Center\n=============\n\n 6 languages\n\n*   [Deutsch](https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trauma_Center \"Trauma Center – German\")\n*   [Français](https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trauma_Center \"Trauma Center – French\")\n*   [Bahasa Indonesia](https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trauma_Center \"Trauma Center – Indonesian\")\n*   [Italiano](https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trauma_center_\\(disambigua\\) \"Trauma center (disambigua) – Italian\")\n*   [한국어](https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%8A%B8%EB%9D%BC%EC%9A%B0%EB%A7%88_%EC%84%BC%ED%84%B0 \"트라우마 센터 – Korean\")\n*   [Nederlands](https://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trauma_Center \"Trauma Center – Dutch\")\n\n[Edit links](https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Special:EntityPage/Q535772#sitelinks-wikipedia \"Edit interlanguage links\")\n\n*   [Article](/wiki/Trauma_Center \"View the content page [c]\")\n*   [Talk](/wiki/Talk:Trauma_Center \"Discuss improvements to the content page [t]\")\n\n English\n\n*   [Read](/wiki/Trauma_Center)\n*   [Edit](/w/index.php?title=Trauma_Center&action=edit \"Edit the source code of this page [e]\")\n*   [View history](/w/index.php?title=Trauma_Center&action=history \"Past revisions of this page [h]\")\n*   [Save](# \"Add this page to your saved items\")\n\n Tools\n\nTools\n\nmove to sidebar hide\n\nActions\n\n*   [Read](/wiki/Trauma_Center)\n*   [Edit](/w/index.php?title=Trauma_Center&action=edit \"Edit the source code of this page [e]\")\n*   [View history](/w/index.php?title=Trauma_Center&action=history \"Past revisions of this page [h]\")\n*   [Save](# \"Add this page to your saved items\")\n\nGeneral\n\n*   [What links here](/wiki/Special:WhatLinksHere/Trauma_Center \"List of all English Wikipedia pages containing links to this page [j]\")\n*   [Related changes](/wiki/Special:RecentChangesLinked/Trauma_Center \"Recent changes in pages linked from this page [k]\")\n*   [Upload file](//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:File_Upload_Wizard \"Upload files [u]\")\n*   [Permanent link](/w/index.php?title=Trauma_Center&oldid=1331855743 \"Permanent link to this revision of this page\")\n*   [Page information](/w/index.php?title=Trauma_Center&action=info \"More information about this page\")\n*   [Cite this page](/w/index.php?title=Special:CiteThisPage&page=Trauma_Center&id=1331855743&wpFormIdentifier=titleform \"Information on how to cite this page\")\n*   [Get shortened URL](/w/index.php?title=Special:UrlShortener&url=https%3A%2F%2Fen.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2FTrauma_Center)\n*   [Switch to legacy parser](/w/index.php?title=Trauma_Center&useparsoid=0)\n\nPrint/export\n\n*   [Download as PDF](/w/index.php?title=Special:DownloadAsPdf&page=Trauma_Center&action=show-download-screen \"Download this page as a PDF file\")\n*   [Printable version](javascript:print\\(\\); \"Printable version of this page [p]\")\n\nIn other projects\n\n*   [Wikidata item](https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Special:EntityPage/Q535772 \"Structured data on this page hosted by Wikidata [g]\")\n\nAppearance\n\nmove to sidebar hide\n\nFrom Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\n(Redirected from [Trauma Center (series)](/w/index.php?title=Trauma_Center_\\(series\\)&redirect=no \"Trauma Center (series)\"))\n\n[![Wiktionary logo](//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/99/Wiktionary-logo-en-v2.svg/40px-Wiktionary-logo-en-v2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Wiktionary-logo-en-v2.svg)\n\nLook up _**[trauma centre](https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/trauma%20centre \"wiktionary:trauma centre\")**_ in Wiktionary, the free dictionary.\n\nA **[trauma center](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trauma_center \"Trauma center\")** is a type of hospital that cares for patients with major traumatic injuries.\n\n**Trauma Center** may also refer to:\n\n*   [_Trauma Center_ (TV series)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trauma_Center_\\(TV_series\\) \"Trauma Center (TV series)\"), a 1983 American medical drama\n*   [_Trauma Center_ (video game series)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trauma_Center_\\(video_game_series\\) \"Trauma Center (video game series)\"), a series of simulation and visual novel games\n    *   _[Trauma Center: Under the Knife](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trauma_Center:_Under_the_Knife \"Trauma Center: Under the Knife\")_, the first entry in the series released in 2005\n*   [_Trauma Center_ (film)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trauma_Center_\\(film\\) \"Trauma Center (film)\"), a 2019 American action thriller film\n\nSee also\n--------\n\n\\[[edit](/w/index.php?title=Trauma_Center&action=edit&section=1 \"Edit section: See also\")\\]\n\n*   [Emergency department](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emergency_department \"Emergency department\")\n\nTopics referred to by the same term\n\n[![Disambiguation icon](//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/5/5f/Disambig_gray.svg/40px-Disambig_gray.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Disambig_gray.svg)\n\nThis [disambiguation](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:Disambiguation \"Help:Disambiguation\") page lists articles associated with the title **Trauma Center**.  \nIf an [internal link](https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere/Trauma_Center&namespace=0) incorrectly led you here, you may wish to change the link to point directly to the intended article.\n\nRetrieved from \"[https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Trauma\\_Center&oldid=1331855743](https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Trauma_Center&oldid=1331855743)\"\n\n[Category](/wiki/Help:Category \"Help:Category\"):\n\n*   [Disambiguation pages](/wiki/Category:Disambiguation_pages \"Category:Disambiguation pages\")\n\nHidden categories:\n\n*   [Short description is different from Wikidata](/wiki/Category:Short_description_is_different_from_Wikidata \"Category:Short description is different from Wikidata\")\n*   [All article disambiguation pages](/wiki/Category:All_article_disambiguation_pages \"Category:All article disambiguation pages\")\n*   [All disambiguation pages](/wiki/Category:All_disambiguation_pages \"Category:All disambiguation pages\")\n\n*   This page was last edited on 8 January 2026, at 15:27 (UTC).\n*   Page was rendered with [Parsoid](https://www.mediawiki.org/wiki/Special:MyLanguage/Parsoid \"mw:Specia