{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjDCJWvFXR8WAxKY6kqf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0178av1xB6T9JNkL6iNisUJv","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261104-211914__x044929/work && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='PLAN.md'; s=open(p,encoding='utf-8').read()\ndef rep(a,b,n=1):\n    global s\n    assert s.count(a)>=1, a[:70]\n    s=s.replace(a,b) if n==0 else s.replace(a,b,n)\n# safe zone and the wheel corner\nrep(\"- ✔ **Playable safe zone: `|x| ≤ 6`, `z ∈ [-3.6, 3.2]`.** The top and bottom HUD strips and the perspective narrowing at the near edge make everything outside it unreliable.\",\n    \"- ✔ **Playable safe zone: `|x| ≤ 6`, `z ∈ [-3.6, 3.0]`.** The top and bottom HUD strips and the perspective narrowing at the near edge make everything outside it unreliable. Keep tasks out of the bottom-right corner too (`x > 5`, `z > 2.4`), where the tool wheel sits.\")\n# strip height, demo banner\nrep(\"  - **Bottom strip, 28 tall:** speaker name and up to two lines of comm text.\",\"  - **Bottom strip, 32 tall:** speaker name and up to two lines of comm text.\")\nrep(\"- Banner `DEMO — PRESS ANY BUTTON`. Any input exits at once to Title and is swallowed.\",\"- Banner `DEMO - PRESS ANY BUTTON`. Any input exits at once to Title and is swallowed.\")\nrep(\"- The font auto-uppercases and has `. , : ; ! ? - + % / ( ) [ ] ' \\\" # & * = < >` ✔.\",\"- The font auto-uppercases and has `. , : ; ! ? - + % / ( ) [ ] ' \\\" # & * = < >` ✔. Anything else, em dashes and ellipsis characters included, draws as a gap: type `-` and `...`.\")\n# Bone Mend and Massage keys that don't fight WASD\nrep(\"rotate while held (right stick, mouse wheel or A/D)\",\"rotate while held (right stick, mouse wheel or Q/E)\")\nrep(\"alternate L2/R2 (left/right click, A/D) on the beat 8 times\",\"alternate L2/R2 (left/right click, J/K) on the beat 8 times\")\n# composure hidden until unlocked\nrep(\"Composure is a shared 0 to 100 meter. It starts at 40 and is shown as a bar at top right.\",\"Composure is a shared 0 to 100 meter. It starts at 40 and is shown as a bar at top right, hidden until The Quiet awakens in Op 3.\")\n# input messages go to the host\nrep(\"- **Clients to host:** 15 Hz unreliable `{t:'i', n, x, z, tool, use, gift, steady}` (always sent, even idle; the harness requires traffic both ways).\",\"- **Clients to host:** 15 Hz `AIHub.send({t:'i', n, x, z, tool, use, gift, steady}, { to: AIHub.host, reliable: false })`, always sent, even idle (the harness requires traffic both ways).\")\n# paint cost, measured at full size\nrep(\"- ✔ Rewriting the whole buffer costs well under 1 ms a frame in JS.\",\"- ✔ Copying the base into the buffer and painting 60 blood discs measured about 0.5 ms a frame.\")\n# gear verified\nrep(\"- Show a DOM overlay with the exact text `Controller or keyboard required`, plus the engine's ⚙ (`settings: { button: 'top-right' }`, which opens the DOM panel).\",\"- Show a DOM overlay with the exact text `Controller or keyboard required`, plus the engine's ⚙: ✔ `settings: { button: 'top-right' }` shows it on a phone profile and a tap opens the DOM panel.\")\n# tendrils verified with the picture\nrep(\"✔ `SpringChain` driven per frame works for tendrils. **Place everything at `heightAt(x, z) + offset`** or the surface swallows it (✔ my mock's boss vanished inside the heart).\",\n    \"✔ My Dies Irae mock (a glowing eye in a crown of seven red plates, `rim` lit, with `SpringChain` tendrils trailing onto the heart) read very well. **Place everything at `heightAt(x, z) + offset`** or the surface swallows it: ✔ my first version sat at a fixed height and vanished inside the dome, and it needed `y` of about 3 over the dome's top.\")\n# vendor folder\nrep(\"tools/build.mjs\\ntests/        run.mjs\",\"vendor/       session.js, harness.html, bridge.js, round.js (from the hub, unmodified)\\ntools/build.mjs\\ntests/        run.mjs\")\n# cursor visibility\nrep(\"**Prompts follow the last input used,** switching the moment another device acts.\",\"**Pointer.** Hide the OS cursor over the canvas during surgery (you draw the reticle). In menus show it only while the mouse was the last device.\\n\\n**Prompts follow the last input used,** switching the moment another device acts.\")\n# charset lint\nrep(\"- Cast and sets referenced exist; every tool used; all text fits two wrapped lines at 342 art pixels wide; glyph tokens valid.\",\"- Cast and sets referenced exist; every tool used; all text fits two wrapped lines at 342 art pixels wide; every character is in the font's set; glyph tokens valid.\")\n# research line\nrep(\"- For the exit-interview file your brief asks for, `aiHub.genre` is `Simulation`\",\"- When you report research, say this plan's planner read the source's Wikipedia page, the hub's protocol and the engine kit, and ran engine spikes; add anything you did yourself.\\n- For the exit-interview file your brief asks for, `aiHub.genre` is `Simulation`\")\nopen(p,'w',encoding='utf-8').write(s)\nEOF\nsed -n 1,60p PLAN.md | cut -c1-200","description":"Apply review corrections to the plan and reread its opening"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1324,"cache_read_input_tokens":473384,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1324},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8b716b92-81c2-4c62-8381-9131b2f861f1","uuid":"731c3d7a-1472-41c1-b725-080b4a58a1e6","timestamp":"2026-11-05T05:15:28.761Z","request_id":"req_011CgjDCJEYYTqNN9Yko9GA6","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_0178av1xB6T9JNkL6iNisUJv":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2